### ✅ **ALL THREE MAJOR ISSUES ADDRESSED:**

## **1. Success Modal Issue - FIXED!** ✅
**Root Cause Identified**: The success message was being set but then `loadBlockchainData()` was causing state conflicts.

**Solution Implemented**:
